Subject: [RFC PATCH v2 5/8] blk-crypto: refuse dma-buf bios in the fallback path
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:06:18 +0800
Message-ID: <20261113070621.273953-6-mengmeng.zhao@linux.dev>
